    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locked Together is a horror experience inspired by escape rooms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into levels, each offering a unique mini-adventure with different environments, items, puzzles, and entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.poster.avif?t=1746519698\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.webm?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.mp4?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face the challenge alone or with friends in co-op. Solve the puzzles and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.poster.avif?t=1746519698\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.webm?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.mp4?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine and interact with items as you try to unravel the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.poster.avif?t=1746519698\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.webm?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.mp4?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>If you'd like to be part of the development process or or stay updated with the latest news, join the <strong>Discord</strong>. Every type of feedback is appreciated!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locked Together is a horror experience inspired by escape rooms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into levels, each offering a unique mini-adventure with different environments, items, puzzles, and entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.poster.avif?t=1746519698\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.webm?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.mp4?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face the challenge alone or with friends in co-op. Solve the puzzles and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.poster.avif?t=1746519698\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.webm?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.mp4?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine and interact with items as you try to unravel the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.poster.avif?t=1746519698\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.webm?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.mp4?t=1746519698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>If you'd like to be part of the development process or or stay updated with the latest news, join the <strong>Discord</strong>. Every type of feedback is appreciated!</p>",
